{{!-- ============================ CHECKOUT PIX ============================ --}}
<section id="checkout" class="relative border-t border-white/5 bg-slate-900/40">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-64 bg-pix-500/10 blur-[120px]"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <span class="eyebrow">{{icone "pix" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"}} Checkout transparente</span>
      <h2 class="section-title mt-4">Finalize sua compra com Pix</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
        Preencha seus dados, escaneie o QR Code (ou use o copia e cola) e receba o download no seu e-mail.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-5xl gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr]">
      {{!-- Formulário --}}
      <div id="painel-formulario" class="card p-6 sm:p-8">
        <form id="form-pix" class="space-y-5" novalidate>
          <div>
            <label class="label" for="nome">Nome completo</label>
            <input id="nome" name="nome" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Como no seu documento" class="field" required>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="label" for="email">E-mail</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="voce@email.com" class="field" required>
            <p class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500">
              {{icone "mail" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"}} O link de download é enviado para este e-mail.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <label class="label" for="cpf">CPF</label>
              <input id="cpf" name="cpf" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="14" placeholder="000.000.000-00" class="field" required>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="label" for="telefone">Telefone <span class="normal-case text-slate-600">(opcional)</span></label>
              <input id="telefone" name="telefone" type="tel" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="15" placeholder="(00) 00000-0000" class="field">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="erro-formulario" class="hidden items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-500/10 p-3 text-sm text-rose-200">
            {{icone "alert" class="mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 shrink-0"}}
            <span id="erro-formulario-texto"></span>
          </div>

          <button id="btn-gerar-pix" type="submit" class="btn-pix btn-lg w-full">
            {{icone "qr" class="w-5 h-5"}}
            <span id="btn-gerar-pix-texto">Gerar QR Code Pix</span>
          </button>

          <p class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
            {{icone "lock" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"}} Ambiente seguro · processado pelo Mercado Pago
          </p>

          <p class="text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
            Já pagou e não recebeu o e-mail?
            <a href="/recuperar" class="font-semibold text-brand-300 transition hover:text-brand-200">Recuperar meu acesso</a>
          </p>
        </form>
      </div>

      {{!-- Painel do QR Code --}}
      <div id="painel-qr" class="card hidden p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">Pague com Pix</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">Use o app do seu banco para concluir.</p>
          </div>
          <button id="btn-cancelar-qr" type="button" class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white">
            {{icone "x" class="w-4 h-4"}}
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-3 shadow-glow">
            <img id="qr-imagem" alt="QR Code Pix" class="h-56 w-56 object-contain">
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">Abra o app do seu banco e escaneie o código acima.</p>

        <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-between text-sm">
          <span class="text-slate-400">Valor</span>
          <span id="qr-valor" class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">R$ 0,00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between text-sm">
          <span class="text-slate-400">Expira em</span>
          <span id="qr-tempo" class="font-mono font-semibold text-pix-300">--:--</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5">
          <label class="label">Pix copia e cola</label>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <input id="qr-codigo" type="text" readonly class="field truncate font-mono text-xs">
            <button id="btn-copiar" type="button" class="btn-ghost shrink-0 px-4">
              {{icone "copy" class="w-4 h-4"}} Copiar
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <span class="relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5">
            <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-pix-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-pix-500"></span>
          </span>
          Verificando o pagamento automaticamente…
        </div>

        <button id="btn-verificar-agora" type="button" class="btn-ghost mt-3 w-full">
          {{icone "refresh" class="w-4 h-4"}}
          <span id="btn-verificar-texto">Já fiz o pagamento — verificar agora</span>
        </button>
        <p class="mt-2 text-center text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          Pode fechar esta página sem medo: assim que o Pix cair, o e-mail com o download é enviado automaticamente.
        </p>
      </div>

      {{!-- Painel de sucesso --}}
      <div id="painel-sucesso" class="card hidden p-8 text-center">
        <span class="mx-auto grid h-16 w-16 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-300 animate-pulse-ring">
          {{icone "check" class="w-8 h-8"}}
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white">Pagamento aprovado!</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Enviamos o link de download para <strong id="sucesso-email" class="text-white"></strong>.
          Verifique também a caixa de spam.
        </p>
        <a href="/recuperar" class="btn-primary mt-6 w-full">Não recebi o e-mail · recuperar acesso</a>
        <a href="/suporte" class="btn-ghost mt-3 w-full">Preciso de ajuda</a>
      </div>

      {{!-- Painel de falha --}}
      <div id="painel-falha" class="card hidden p-8 text-center">
        <span class="mx-auto grid h-16 w-16 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-rose-500/15 text-rose-300">
          {{icone "alert" class="w-8 h-8"}}
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white">Pagamento não aprovado</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Não identificamos o pagamento. Você pode gerar um novo QR Code sem custo.
        </p>
        <button id="btn-tentar-novamente" type="button" class="btn-pix mt-6 w-full">Gerar novo QR Code</button>
      </div>

      {{!-- Resumo --}}
      <aside class="card-strong h-fit p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white">Resumo do pedido</h3>
        <dl class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-slate-400">Produto</dt>
            <dd class="text-right font-medium text-white">{{produto.nome}}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-slate-400">Entrega</dt>
            <dd class="text-right font-medium text-pix-300">Digital · imediata</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-slate-400">Forma de pagamento</dt>
            <dd class="text-right font-medium text-white">Pix</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <div class="my-5 h-px bg-white/10"></div>
        <div class="flex items-end justify-between">
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Total</span>
          <span class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">{{preco_formatado}}</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">{{icone "check" class="w-4 h-4 text-pix-400"}} Acesso liberado na hora</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">{{icone "check" class="w-4 h-4 text-pix-400"}} Guia de instalação incluso</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">{{icone "check" class="w-4 h-4 text-pix-400"}} 7 dias de garantia</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

